    new "To split one network into 4, you borrow bits from the host part. How many bits do you need to make 4? Then count how many hosts are left."

    old "Sa /20, bawat subnet ay may sukat na 16 sa ikatlong numero: 0-15, 16-31, at iba pa. Bilangin hanggang sa ikatlong subnet. Ang broadcast address ay ang huling address ng bloke na iyon."
    new "With /20, each subnet is 16 wide in the third number: 0-15, 16-31, and so on. Count up to the third subnet. The broadcast address is the last address of that block."

    old "Ang wildcard mask ay kabaligtaran ng subnet mask: ang mga '1' ay nagiging '0' at ang '0' ay nagiging '1'. Alamin muna ang subnet mask ng /27, saka baliktarin."
    new "A wildcard mask is the opposite of a subnet mask: the 1s become 0s and the 0s become 1s. First find the subnet mask of /27, then flip it."

